{"id":"f5c91ae1bfe4e751","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md","title":"Lowenheim Skolem","display":"thm-lowenheim-skolem — Lowenheim Skolem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-lowenheim-skolem","aliases":["58-thm-lowenheim-skolem"],"display":"thm-lowenheim-skolem — Lowenheim Skolem","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-language.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-lowenheim-skolem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-lowenheim-skolem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lowenheim-skolem — Lowenheim Skolem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-language.md\">../batch01/58-df-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> (parameter set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,L)\\)</span> (elementary-substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\n\\land\n|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal N)|\n\\leq\\max\\bigl(|A|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\n\\land\n|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal N)|\n\\leq\\max\\bigl(|A|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the downward Löwenheim–Skolem theorem with parameters.</li>\n<li>For a prescribed infinite cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\geq|A|+|L|\">\\(\\kappa\\geq|A|+|L|\\)</span>, the displayed bound yields an elementary substructure of size at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)$ ($L$-structure, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,L)$ (elementary-substructure predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\